{"context":"hono-pds","id":5165774942486094,"kind":"interface","label":"SpecInterface","name":"CreateFromEnvOptions","scope":"","signature":"interface CreateFromEnvOptions { keyHex?: string; didWebServicesStr?: string; publicHostname?: string; crawlersStr?: string; log?: Logger }"}
{"context":"hono-pds","id":5229563464116738,"label":"SpecRequirement","level":"MUST","reqId":"r.start-options-superset","scope":"","text":"StartOptions must carry the required port and hostname for the HTTP bind plus the optional keyHex, didWebServicesStr, publicHostname, crawlersStr and log fields, and must be accepted directly as the CreateFromEnvOptions argument to createFromEnv."}
