{"context":"hono-pds","id":6994281831804408,"label":"SpecRequirement","level":"MUST","reqId":"r.start-serves-app","scope":"","text":"start must create the repo through createFromEnv with the StartOptions, serve repo.app.fetch with Deno.serve bound to options.port and options.hostname, log an info entry with the port in the onListen callback, and return a StartResult carrying app, server, repo and port."}
{"context":"hono-pds","id":6997169569361298,"kind":"interface","label":"SpecInterface","name":"StartResult","scope":"","signature":"interface StartResult { app: RepoFactory[\"app\"]; server: Deno.HttpServer; repo: RepoFactory; port: number }"}
{"context":"hono-pds","id":7971778674132110,"label":"SpecRequirement","level":"MUST","reqId":"r.factory-wiring","scope":"","text":"createFromEnv must build the RepoFactory via createRepoFactory with Deno KV storage, the signer produced from the keypair, publicKeyDid set to the signer DID, publicHostname from opts, the normalised crawlers, didWebServices only when the parsed list is non-empty, and an enabled OAuth server whose issuer is http://127.0.0.1:2583."}
{"context":"hono-pds","id":8241199993556065,"label":"SpecRequirement","level":"SHOULD","reqId":"r.default-logger","scope":"","text":"createFromEnv and start must use opts.log when supplied and otherwise fall back to the module-level defaultLog, so logging is never undefined at the call sites."}
{"context":"lib-abc-atproto-oauth-server","id":1800122400874946,"label":"SpecRequirement","level":"MUST","reqId":"r.dpop-nonce-issue-verify","scope":"","text":"DpopNonceStore issues a nonce for an origin and verifies a supplied nonce against that origin, resolving the verification to a boolean so callers can reject replayed or foreign-origin proofs."}
{"context":"lib-abc-atproto-oauth-server","id":2293860416438902,"kind":"interface","label":"SpecInterface","name":"IssueTokenResult","scope":"","signature":"interface IssueTokenResult { accessToken: string; refreshToken: string; expiresIn: number }"}
{"context":"lib-abc-atproto-oauth-server","id":40357382889534,"label":"SpecRequirement","level":"MUST","reqId":"r.token-store-refresh","scope":"","text":"TokenStore.refresh takes a refresh token and resolves to a fresh IssueTokenResult, or to null when the refresh token is unknown or unusable."}
{"context":"lib-abc-atproto-oauth-server","id":4280725570524621,"kind":"interface","label":"SpecInterface","name":"DpopProofValidation","scope":"","signature":"interface DpopProofValidation { jkt: string; jti: string }"}
{"context":"lib-abc-atproto-oauth-server","id":5714957929877419,"label":"SpecRequirement","level":"MUST","reqId":"r.issue-token-params-binding","scope":"","text":"IssueTokenParams carries the user DID, handle, an optional scope, and a required jkt — the SHA-256 thumbprint of the client DPoP public key — so an issued token is bound to one specific client DPoP key."}
{"context":"lib-abc-atproto-oauth-server","id":5804440102378389,"label":"SpecRequirement","level":"MUST","reqId":"r.token-store-validate","scope":"","text":"TokenStore.validate takes an access token and resolves either to a TokenValidation exposing sub, optional handle, scope, and jkt, or to null when the token is not valid, rather than throwing."}
{"context":"lib-abc-atproto-oauth-server","id":5856859875820386,"label":"SpecRequirement","level":"MUST","reqId":"r.injected-session-shape","scope":"","text":"InjectedSession holds the session data typed as OAuthSessionData alongside the DPoP CryptoKeyPair, so the caller can both persist the session and sign subsequent DPoP proofs with the same key."}
{"context":"lib-abc-atproto-oauth-server","id":6632999574892174,"kind":"interface","label":"SpecInterface","name":"DpopVerifier","scope":"","signature":"interface DpopVerifier { verifyProof(proof: string, method: string, url: string, accessToken?: string): Promise\u003cDpopProofValidation | null\u003e }"}
{"context":"lib-abc-atproto-oauth-server","id":6840396033986002,"label":"SpecRequirement","level":"MUST","reqId":"r.token-store-issue","scope":"","text":"TokenStore.issue accepts IssueTokenParams and resolves to an IssueTokenResult containing the access token, refresh token, and expiry in seconds."}
{"context":"lib-abc-atproto-oauth-server","id":716456723706945,"label":"SpecRequirement","level":"MUST","reqId":"r.token-store-revoke","scope":"","text":"TokenStore.revoke takes a token and resolves to void, invalidating it without reporting a result."}
{"context":"lib-abc-atproto-oauth-server","id":7468185284300977,"kind":"interface","label":"SpecInterface","name":"SessionInjector","scope":"","signature":"interface SessionInjector { injectSession(opts: { userDid: string; handle: string; scope?: string }): Promise\u003cInjectedSession\u003e }"}
{"context":"lib-abc-atproto-oauth-server","id":7637361718405479,"label":"SpecRequirement","level":"MUST","reqId":"r.pure-interfaces-no-io","scope":"","text":"The module declares only pure interfaces and must import no I/O or runtime primitives — no fetch, no crypto, no timers, no Deno.* — so any implementation package can satisfy the contracts."}
{"context":"lib-abc-atproto-oauth-server","id":781009993560403,"kind":"interface","label":"SpecInterface","name":"TokenValidation","scope":"","signature":"interface TokenValidation { sub: string; handle?: string; scope: string; jkt: string }"}
{"context":"lib-abc-atproto-oauth-server","id":7859765338483901,"label":"SpecRequirement","level":"MUST","reqId":"r.dpop-verify-proof","scope":"","text":"DpopVerifier.verifyProof takes the serialized proof, the HTTP method, the request URL, and an optional access token, and resolves to a DpopProofValidation stating the jkt and jti, or to null when the proof does not verify."}
{"context":"lib-abc-atproto-oauth-server","id":8039778982255425,"kind":"interface","label":"SpecInterface","name":"TokenStore","scope":"","signature":"interface TokenStore { issue(params: IssueTokenParams): Promise\u003cIssueTokenResult\u003e; validate(accessToken: string): Promise\u003cTokenValidation | null\u003e; refresh(refreshToken: string): Promise\u003cIssueTokenResult | null\u003e; revoke(token: string): Promise\u003cvoid\u003e }"}
{"context":"lib-abc-atproto-oauth-server","id":8117089667985239,"label":"SpecRequirement","level":"MUST","reqId":"r.inject-session","scope":"","text":"SessionInjector.injectSession takes a user DID, handle, and optional scope, and resolves to an InjectedSession pairing the OAuthSessionData with the CryptoKeyPair used for DPoP."}
{"context":"lib-abc-atproto-oauth-server","id":8409093699431633,"kind":"interface","label":"SpecInterface","name":"InjectedSession","scope":"","signature":"interface InjectedSession { sessionData: OAuthSessionData; dpopKeyPair: CryptoKeyPair }"}
