{"context":"lib-abc-atproto-repo","id":1230412167296163,"label":"SpecRequirement","level":"MUST","reqId":"r.mst-root-and-size","scope":"","text":"Mst.root returns the current root Cid, or null when the tree is empty, and Mst.size returns the number of key entries held."}
{"context":"lib-abc-atproto-repo","id":1298495264805997,"label":"SpecRequirement","level":"SHOULD","reqId":"r.abc-layer-isolation","scope":"","text":"The MST implementation depends only on the abstract BlockStore and Hasher contracts and performs no I/O beyond them, keeping this layer free of any concrete database or HTTP transport."}
{"context":"lib-abc-atproto-repo","id":1656132758912657,"label":"SpecRequirement","level":"MUST","reqId":"r.mst-init","scope":"","text":"Mst.init loads the tree from its BlockStore before use, so subsequent reads and writes operate on nodes that have already been fetched."}
