{"context":"lib-abc-atproto-repo","id":812724380506834,"label":"SpecRequirement","level":"MUST","reqId":"r.storage-boundaries","scope":"","text":"BlockStore is the content-addressed block boundary keyed by Cid and Storage layers record persistence above it, while RepoStore records each repo's head as a commit Cid paired with a rev Tid, returning null from getHead when a repo has no head yet and overwriting it through setHead."}
